            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then what advantage has the Jew? Or what is the value of circumcision? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.147.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 147.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Much in every way. To begin with, the Jews are entrusted with the oracles of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What if some were unfaithful? Does their faithlessness nullify the faithfulness of God? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.51.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 51.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " By no means! Let God be true though every man be false, as it is written,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
