              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 10.34-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Or is God the God of Jews only? Is he not the God of Gentiles also? Yes, of Gentiles also, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
